              <div
                class="build-tile__body"
              >
                <h3
                  class="build-tile__title"
                >
                  Real Fake Birds
                </h3>
                <p
                  class="build-tile__teaser"
                >
                  Some are real. Some are fake. Tell them apart.
                </p>
                <p
                  class="build-tile__desc"
                >
                  Earn badges and extend your streak in this real-or-fake guessing game that puts even the most ardent birders to the test.
                </p>
